{"seq":2,"slug":"terrain-collision","title":"地形碰撞与物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/practice/terrain-collision","wordCount":1781,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"地形碰撞与物理\">地形碰撞与物理</h1><p>玩家在地形上走、车在地形上开、子弹打在地形上溅起尘土——这些交互的背后都是地形碰撞。它有一个对渲染人来说反直觉的特点：碰撞用的地形数据和渲染用的几乎是两套独立的东西。渲染要的是按距离细分的漂亮网格，碰撞要的是查询飞快、内存极省的紧凑结构。好在高度场再次展现它的优雅——它能把&quot;角色脚下地面有多高&quot;这种查询压到近乎 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这一篇讲清地形碰撞为何与渲染解耦，以及各类查询如何高效求解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-碰撞表示与渲染表示的解耦\">核心概念：碰撞表示与渲染表示的解耦</h2><p>地形碰撞的第一原则是：<strong>不要拿渲染网格做碰撞</strong>。渲染网格有 LOD、有裙边、有为视觉服务的细节，逐三角形碰撞既慢又随 LOD 变化而抖动。物理引擎为地形提供专门的<strong>高度场碰撞体（heightfield collider）</strong>——直接拿高度场数据当碰撞几何，按需在查询时局部三角化，省下整套显式三角网格的存储。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[渲染表示&lt;br/&gt;LOD 网格 + 裙边] -.解耦.-&gt; B[碰撞表示&lt;br/&gt;高度场 collider]&#10;    B --&gt; C{查询类型}&#10;    C --&gt;|脚下高度| D[xz 定位格子&lt;br/&gt;双线性插值 O 1]&#10;    C --&gt;|射线检测| E[沿 xz 走格子&lt;br/&gt;逐格求交]&#10;    C --&gt;|胶囊/扫掠| F[局部三角化&lt;br/&gt;narrow phase]&#10;    D --&gt; G[角色贴地/重力]&#10;    E --&gt; H[弹道/拾取/放置]&#10;    F --&gt; I[车辆/角色推挤]\">flowchart TD\n    A[渲染表示&lt;br/&gt;LOD 网格 + 裙边] -.解耦.-&gt; B[碰撞表示&lt;br/&gt;高度场 collider]\n    B --&gt; C{查询类型}\n    C --&gt;|脚下高度| D[xz 定位格子&lt;br/&gt;双线性插值 O 1]\n    C --&gt;|射线检测| E[沿 xz 走格子&lt;br/&gt;逐格求交]\n    C --&gt;|胶囊/扫掠| F[局部三角化&lt;br/&gt;narrow phase]\n    D --&gt; G[角色贴地/重力]\n    E --&gt; H[弹道/拾取/放置]\n    F --&gt; I[车辆/角色推挤]</pre><p>下表对比地形可选的几种碰撞表示，解释为何高度场几乎总是首选：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>碰撞表示</th>\n<th>查询速度</th>\n<th>内存</th>\n<th>能否悬挑</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高度场 collider</td>\n<td>极快（查表）</td>\n<td>极省</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>绝大多数地表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角网格 collider</td>\n<td>慢（BVH 遍历）</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>洞穴/拱门局部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>简化代理几何</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>省</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>远景/低精度区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体素 collider</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>可破坏地形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"脚下高度查询-高度场为何近乎-o-1\">脚下高度查询：高度场为何近乎 O(1)</h2><p>最高频的地形查询是&quot;角色当前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 处地面有多高&quot;——每个站在地上的角色每帧都要问一次，用于贴地与重力。在高度场上这是常数时间：用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 直接算出落在哪个格子，取该格四个角的高度做<strong>双线性插值</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>00</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>v</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>01</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(x,z) = (1-u)(1-v)h_{00} + u(1-v)h_{10} + (1-u)v\\,h_{01} + uv\\,h_{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">00</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">01</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u,v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是格内归一化坐标。无需任何空间结构遍历，无需求交测试。这正是高度场相对三角网格碰撞的决定性优势——成百上千个 NPC 同时贴地行走，每个每帧一次查表，开销几乎可忽略。坡度（决定角色能否站稳、是否打滑）同样由这四个角的差分立即得到，复用 <a href=\"../foundations/heightmaps-representation\">基础</a> 章的法线推导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"射线与扫掠-弹道-拾取与角色推挤\">射线与扫掠：弹道、拾取与角色推挤</h2><p><strong>射线检测</strong>（弹道命中、鼠标拾取地面、贴花放置）在高度场上用 DDA 思路：把射线投影到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 平面，沿途逐格行进，每进入一个格子就用该格的两个三角形与射线求交，命中即返回。由于只走射线扫过的那一列格子，复杂度与射线长度相关而与地形总面积无关，远快于对整个三角网格做 BVH 求交。</p>\n<p><strong>扫掠/重叠查询</strong>（胶囊体表示的角色推挤地形、车轮压地）则需要 narrow phase：取角色包围范围内的若干格子，局部三角化后与胶囊/凸体做连续碰撞检测。这一步与通用刚体碰撞共享算法——窄相算法、连续碰撞检测的细节属于 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">游戏物理 · 窄相检测</a>，本节只强调地形的特殊优化：因为地形是高度场，可以先用脚下高度查询快速排除&quot;角色明显悬空或深埋&quot;的情形，只在贴近地表时才进昂贵的窄相。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态地形-可破坏与位移的碰撞同步\">动态地形：可破坏与位移的碰撞同步</h2><p>静态地形碰撞简单，难点在地形会变。两类场景。其一，<strong>位移地形</strong>——爆炸炸出弹坑、车辙压出凹陷：高度场被运行时改写后，必须同步更新对应区域的碰撞体（与 <a href=\"terrain-authoring\">编辑器回灌</a> 同一机制，只是发生在运行时），且只更新被改的脏块，否则每次爆炸都全图重建碰撞会卡死。其二，<strong>可破坏体素地形</strong>——挖洞、塌方：高度场无法表达洞，这类区域必须切到三角网格或体素 collider，碰撞随 <a href=\"../foundations/voxel-vs-heightfield\">体素表面提取</a> 一同重建，开销显著更高，这也是为何可破坏地形物理代价大的原因之一。</p>\n<p>无论哪类，关键纪律都是<strong>脏块局部更新 + 分摊到多帧</strong>——一次大爆炸影响多块时，碰撞重建可以排队跨几帧完成，配合 <a href=\"terrain-performance\">地形性能预算</a> 的每帧配额，避免单帧尖峰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战陷阱-穿模-抖动与多层地形\">实战陷阱：穿模、抖动与多层地形</h2><p>地形碰撞在落地时有几个反复出现的坑，值得单独点名。其一是<strong>高速穿模（tunneling）</strong>：子弹或快速坠落的角色在一帧内位移超过一个格子，若只在帧末做位置检测，可能&quot;穿过&quot;薄地表而不触发碰撞。对策是连续碰撞检测——用上一帧到本帧的扫掠射线求交，而非仅检测终点，这与刚体的连续碰撞同源。</p>\n<p>其二是<strong>贴地抖动（jitter）</strong>：角色脚下高度查询若每帧返回略有差异的值（浮点误差、双线性插值在格子边界的不连续），会让角色微微上下颤动。务实做法是给贴地加一个小容差区间（dead zone）——只有地面高度变化超过阈值才调整角色 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>，并对结果做一帧平滑。</p>\n<p>其三是<strong>多层地形（桥洞、栈道）</strong>。高度场对一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 只有唯一高度，所以&quot;桥下能走、桥上也能走&quot;这种上下两层可通行结构高度场表达不了。常见折中是主地表用高度场，桥梁/栈道这类局部用独立的三角网格 collider 叠加，角色在两层间切换时由游戏逻辑判断&quot;当前归属哪一层&quot;。这再次印证了 <a href=\"../foundations/voxel-vs-heightfield\">体素与高度场之争</a> 里的边界——一旦交互需要真正的上下叠合，高度场就必须让位或补充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>地形碰撞与渲染解耦：用专门的高度场 collider 而非渲染网格，省内存、不随 LOD 抖动。</li>\n<li>脚下高度查询在高度场上是近乎 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的双线性插值，支撑成百上千 NPC 同时贴地，是高度场相对三角网格的决定性优势。</li>\n<li>射线检测沿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 逐格 DDA 求交，复杂度与射线长度相关；扫掠查询走 narrow phase，但可先用高度查询快速排除明显悬空/深埋。</li>\n<li>动态位移地形改写高度场后须同步更新脏块碰撞；可破坏体素地形须切三角网格/体素 collider 并随表面提取重建，代价更高。</li>\n<li>动态碰撞的纪律是脏块局部更新 + 跨帧分摊，纳入每帧物理预算避免尖峰。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>碰撞复用的数据：<a href=\"../foundations/heightmaps-representation\">高度场与地形表示</a>；动态改写的同源机制：<a href=\"terrain-authoring\">地形编辑与制作</a>。</li>\n<li>可破坏地形碰撞的根源：<a href=\"../foundations/voxel-vs-heightfield\">体素与高度场之争</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">游戏物理 · 窄相检测</a>——地形扫掠查询复用的通用碰撞算法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地形碰撞与物理","id":"地形碰撞与物理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：碰撞表示与渲染表示的解耦","id":"核心概念-碰撞表示与渲染表示的解耦"},{"level":2,"text":"脚下高度查询：高度场为何近乎 O(1)","id":"脚下高度查询-高度场为何近乎-o-1"},{"level":2,"text":"射线与扫掠：弹道、拾取与角色推挤","id":"射线与扫掠-弹道-拾取与角色推挤"},{"level":2,"text":"动态地形：可破坏与位移的碰撞同步","id":"动态地形-可破坏与位移的碰撞同步"},{"level":2,"text":"实战陷阱：穿模、抖动与多层地形","id":"实战陷阱-穿模-抖动与多层地形"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"地形编辑与制作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/practice/terrain-authoring"},"next":{"title":"地形性能预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/practice/terrain-performance"}}